{"id":"cuerpo","lemma":"cuerpo","pos":"noun","rank":311,"glosses":["body (the physical structure of a human or animal)","body, torso","body, corpse"],"ipa":"/ˈkweɾpo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"cuerpos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1e/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-cuerpo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Me duele todo el cuerpo.","en":"I ache all over.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/538006","words":[{"g":"me"},null,{"g":"all"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Su caballo ganó por tres cuerpos.","en":"His horse won by three lengths.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1061758","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"horse"},{"g":"to gain","l":"ganar"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"three"},null]},{"text":"Tiene un cuerpo perfecto.","en":"He has a perfect body.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/702912","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"perfect"}]},{"text":"Tres de los cuerpos tenían heridas de bala.","en":"Three of the bodies had gunshot wounds.","words":[{"g":"three"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"hurt, injured","l":"herido"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"bullet"}]},{"text":"¿Dónde se encontró el cuerpo?","en":"Where was the body found?","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to meet","l":"encontrar"},{"g":"the"},null]}]}